# ==============================================================================
# NAME: OpenAI, ChatGPT & Codex Complete Rule-Set (OpenAI.list)
# DESCRIPTION: Covers ChatGPT Web/App, OpenAI API, Codex CLI, Playground,
#              Sora, Realtime API, Auth0, Telemetry/Analytics & ASN/IPs.
# UPDATED: 2026-10
# USAGE IN SURGE (Surge.conf):
#   RULE-SET,OpenAI.list,OpenAI,extended-matching
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Core OpenAI & ChatGPT Domains (核心主站、API 与官方短链)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaiusercontent.com

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Explicit Key Endpoints (核心 API、后台、认证与静态资源显式声明)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# API & Developer Console / Playground
DOMAIN,api.openai.com
DOMAIN,platform.openai.com
DOMAIN,api.chatgpt.com
DOMAIN,chat.openai.com
DOMAIN,sora.com
DOMAIN,www.sora.com

# Auth0 Authentication (OpenAI 统一登录与账号鉴权中心)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,auth0.com
DOMAIN,openai-sso.auth0.com

# Static CDN & Assets
DOMAIN,cdn.openai.com
DOMAIN,files.oaiusercontent.com

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Realtime API, WebSockets & Experimental Endpoints (实时语音、实时 API 与 Codex 终端通道)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DOMAIN,realtime.api.openai.com
DOMAIN,chatgpt-async.com

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Telemetry, Analytics & Feature Flags (遥测、统计与客户端风控校验 - 建议保留)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DOMAIN,o33249.ingest.sentry.io
DOMAIN,events.statsigapi.net
DOMAIN,browser-intake-datadoghq.com
DOMAIN,config.statsig.com

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Process & Client User-Agent Rules (macOS / Windows 客户端与 CLI 进程匹配)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# USER-AGENT,ChatGPT*
# USER-AGENT,*chatgpt*
# PROCESS-NAME,ChatGPT
# PROCESS-NAME,ChatGPT Helper
# PROCESS-NAME,codex

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. OpenAI Official ASN & Anycast IP Blocks (OpenAI 官方自治系统号与专属 IP 段)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
IP-CIDR,24.199.123.0/24,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,64.23.132.0/24,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,138.199.38.0/24,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,159.223.0.0/16,no-resolve
IP-CIDR6,2a09:f180::/32,no-resolve
IP-ASN,394711,no-resolve
